text:
@IndiGo6E This was our way back from CCU on Indigo 6E-115 to DXB on 12th July (19:05).
I and my friend had to go through a miserable travel experience ever.
@IndiGo6E customer service agent Soham and his superior (Chandrajit Saynal) have no information about their job duties.
They have not let us onboard claiming non-residents of UAE to my friend and we struggled to make them understand with all the documents & web proof. Though my status was to take this flight Mr Soham didn't allow me to as we have one PNR (QNCTNM) so I cannot travel without him. Eventually, they got me late arriving for my official appointment I had to face consequences for the same.  @MoCA_GoI @DGCAIndia @IndiGo6E 
And the next flight didn't arouse any unempathetic experience @airindiain
